      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MORNING DAWN (5) was game in defeat off the inside draw last start, finishing second and beaten half a length (22.63) behind Monarch at Shepparton. Overdue and gets her chance. NICMAC ACE (2) drew an outside box and was game in defeat when only 1.4 lengths from the winner Chic In Paris in second(25.85) at Shepparton. Form from his last run is proving strong. Expecting another good run. BLACKBERRY JUICE (4) ran good time (28.58) when placing two back at this track but missed the frame latest in a Rank Limit - Restricted Win at this track. Key player on best and worth another try. COLLINDA RAMSAY (7) has been in the frame at his last two runs, most recently when third (24.58) in a Rank Limit - Grade 6 over 425m at this track.",
